{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat collab/m012e-report.log collab/1792400000000-reviewer-antlr-multi-m012-regate.gpt-6.1-sol.stdout.log'","aggregated_output":"cat: collab/1792400000000-reviewer-antlr-multi-m012-regate.gpt-6.1-sol.stdout.log: No such file or directory\nThe Node lane is still running and a background waiter will notify me when it ends; I'll wait for that notification.\n\nI added the NEWLINE and DEDENT error-coordinate fixtures to `test/yang/python/antlr/cst_export_test.cljc`, and they pass on the JVM, Node and Dart. The commit on `antlr-multi` is `a18666fb`. I did not push and did not touch master.\n\nThe new test is `helper-token-error-coordinates-test`. Each case uses the strict `conformance/check-error` oracle, so the error packet is checked for conformance on each host. The coordinates are pinned per host from each host's own failing probe, not copied across.\n\n**Fixture sources**\n- NEWLINE: `\"if x:\\n    x =\\n\"`. This is the re-gate's probe source.\n- DEDENT: `\"if x:\\n    @d\\ny = 1\\n\"`. A decorator with no definition followed by a dedent puts the error on the DEDENT token. I tried inconsistent-dedent sources first, but the JVM accepted them with no error.\n\n**Pinned coordinates**\n\n| fixture | host | line | column | byte span |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| NEWLINE | JVM | 3 | 0 | [13 14] |\n| NEWLINE | Node | 3 | 0 | [13 14] |\n| NEWLINE | Dart | 2 | 7 | [13 14] |\n| DEDENT | JVM | 2 | 0 | [13 13] |\n| DEDENT | Node | 3 | 0 | [13 13] |\n| DEDENT | Dart | 2 | 6 | [13 13] |\n\nThe byte span agrees on every host. Only line and column differ, because each target's indentation helper reports its own.\n\n**Lane results**\n- **JVM:** `cst-export-test` ran 16 tests with 173 assertions and 0 failures. I did not run `python-antlr-test` on the JVM: no such namespace exists, and the wildcard run (`-r 'yang.python.antlr.*'`) hit the time limit and was stopped.\n- **Node (`bb test:cljs`):** 4078 tests, 0 failures, and `cst-export-test` ran.\n- **Dart (`bb test:cljd`):** all tests passed, and `cst-export-test` ran.\n- **Lint and format:** kondo reports 0 errors and 0 warnings on the changed file. `cljstyle check` produced no complaints, and the commit hook's formatter also ran.\n\nNothing is open. I did not hit the \"Patch does not apply\" error. The Node lane takes more than 10 minutes, so I ran it in the background. The logs `collab/m012e-{jvm,node,dart}.log` are untracked, like the other collab files.\n\nThat was the last background waiter finishing. It matches the Node result I already reported: 4078 tests, 0 failures. There's nothing new to act on, and the work is complete as in my report above (commit `a18666fb`, not pushed).\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
